  },
  {
    "id": "P0212",
    "report": "D",
    "text": "Expected: `[private]` continues to suppress the annotated alias or module from listings after formatting.\n\n"
  },
  {
    "id": "P0213",
    "report": "D",
    "text": "Observed: executed before/after tests showed that `--fmt` removes `[private]` from both constructs. The formerly hidden alias and module then appeared in `--list`.\n\n"
  },
  {
    "id": "P0214",
    "report": "D",
    "text": "Consequence: formatting changes the command interface presented to users.\n\n"
  },
  {
    "id": "P0215",
    "report": "D",
    "text": "serialize alias attributes and the module\u2019s privacy flag. Add behavioral format-and-list tests; the current round-trip helper checks repeated dumps rather than preservation of the original behavior.\n\n"
  },
  {
    "id": "P0216",
    "report": "D",
    "text": "Relative search ceilings are ignored\n\n"
